<title>USA: St Paul hogs $0.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul hogs $0.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50 higher. Top $59.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3     220-250 lbs    59.00</p>
<p>	     250-260 lbs    58.50-59.00</p>
<p>	     260-270 lbs    57.50-58.50</p>
<p>US 2-3     270-280 lbs    56.50-57.50</p>
<p>US 2-4     280-290 lbs    55.50-56.50</p>
<p>Sows: Steady to 0.50 higher. Top 47.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3     300-450 lbs   46.00</p>
<p>	     450-550 lbs   46.50</p>
<p>	     550-700 lbs   47.00</p>
